  data: {
    LLM: 'Game: Zsírozás. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: "Zsírozás ('Greasing') is a traditional Hungarian trick game. 2-4 players. 32-card Hungarian deck. Suits are IRRELEVANT. Win trick by matching rank of led card (last match wins). Sevens are WILD. Capture 'zsír' (grease) cards: Aces + Tens (10pts each, 80 total). 40+ pts wins hand.",
    objective: "Capture the majority of the 80 card-points in the pack: aces and tens (zsír, 'grease') count 10 points each; win a hand by taking 40 or more of these points.",
    gameplay: "Lead any card. Win by playing SAME RANK as led card (last match wins). Seven = WILD (matches any led). 'Greasing': winner can extend trick by leading again. A=10pts, 10=10pts. Total=80. 40+ wins. Tie: last trick winner wins.",
    keyRules: [
      'Suits irrelevant',
      'Match rank to win (last wins)',
      'Sevens are wild',
      'Greasing extends tricks',
      'A=10, 10=10, total 80',
